<P STYLE="font: bold 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-right: 0pt; text-align: justify">Disclaimer</P>

<P STYLE="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; background-color: white">This
press release includes &ldquo;forward-looking statements&rdquo; within the meaning of the safe harbor provisions of the United States
